<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <!-- Include the shared header partial -->
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= cdnUrl %>/css/modal_styles.css?v=<%= typeof version !== 'undefined' ? version : Date.now() %>">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Include the shared header -->
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <%- include('partials/banner') %>

    <main>
        <h1>About Wavelength</h1>
        <section class="about-description">
            <p>Wavelength Lore is an original animated fantasy web series that re-imagines the fundamental relationship between music and magic. In this richly detailed universe, music is not just entertainment; it is a life-saving power, an ultimate source of magical energy that can be wielded by those who master its complexities.
                <br /><br />
                The series introduces a world of compelling characters, intricate narratives, and an evocative original soundtrack that is deeply integral to the story itself. The central conflict revolves around the legendary Battle for the Shire, where the heroes must utilize every chord and melody as a weapon against the formidable Goblin King and the dark forces he commands.
                <br /><br />
                Dive in to explore the origins of the lore, meet the key players, watch the animated episodes, and discover how sound is the definitive key to survival.</p>
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="character-carousel">
            <section class="carousel">
                <div class="carousel-container" id="character-carousel">
                    <% characterImages.forEach(image => { %>
                        <div>
                            <img src="<%= cdnUrl %><%= image %>" alt="Character Image">
                        </div>
                    <% }); %>
                </div>
            </section>

            <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js"></script>
            <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/slick-carousel/1.8.1/slick.min.js"></script>
            <script>
                $(document).ready(function() {
                    $('#character-carousel').slick({
                        infinite: true,
                        slidesToShow: 3,
                        slidesToScroll: 1,
                        autoplay: true,
                        autoplaySpeed: 4000,
                        dots: true,
                        arrows: true
                    });
                });
            </script>
        </section>

        <div id="imageModal" class="modal">
            <span class="modal-close">&times;</span>
            <img class="modal-content" id="fullSizeImage">
        </div>

    
    </main>

    <!-- Include the shared footer -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>